Package: agentlet
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: small terminal AI agent with streaming and tools
 agentlet connects to OpenAI-compatible chat APIs, executes programs,
 accepts images, and compacts context with model-maintained memory.
 Sessions preserve full history as JSON. The single binary uses only
 the Go standard library.
